93 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 73 0 R
/E (Transformers are essential components of electrical power systems, as they enable the transfer of electrical energy between circuits at different voltage levels. They are widely used in power generation, transmission, distribution, and industrial applications. However, transformers may experience abnormal operating conditions such as overvoltage, undervoltage, overcurrent, and excessive temperature, which can affect their performance, reduce their service life, and potentially lead to equipment damage. Therefore, an effective protection system is necessary to ensure the safe and reliable operation of transformers.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
